; MUSIK_YM.INF -- which YM piece plays for which of Thalion's pieces, when
; the YM plays (ST, STE; Falcon with MUSIC=YM in AMBER.INF).  Read at start.
; Template tools/musik_ym.inf, built into the game too (docs/13 3.4).
;
; Per line: Thalion's number (1-32), YM piece (1-18, 0 = silent).  The YM
; number is the subtune of ambermon.snd in an SNDH player.  ";" starts a
; comment; if a number comes twice, the last line counts.  At most 2047
; bytes are read.
;
;Th YM  Thalion's title (the YM's title only where it differs)
  1  0 ; Who said "Hi Ho" ?
  2 13 ; Mellow camel funk
  3  0 ; Close to the hedge
  4  8 ; Voice of the bagpipe
  5  4 ; Downtown
  6  1 ; SHIP (YM: He is sailing; only guessed by the name)
  7  6 ; Whole lotta dove
  8 10 ; Horse is no disgrace
  9  3 ; Don't look Bach
 10  0 ; Rough waterfront tavern
 11 14 ; Sapphire fireballs of pure love
 12  0 ; The Aum remains the same
 13  7 ; CAPITAL
 14 12 ; Plodding along
 15  2 ; Compact disc
 16 11 ; Riverside travelling blues
 17  9 ; Nobody's vault but mine
 18  5 ; La Crypta Strangiato
 19  0 ; Misty dungeon hop
 20  0 ; Burn baby burn!
 21  0 ; Bar brawlin' (camp)
 22  0 ; Psychedelic dune groove
 23  0 ; Stairway to level 50 (fanfare)
 24  0 ; That hunch is back
 25  0 ; Chicken soup
 26  0 ; Dragon chase in creepy dungeon
 27  0 ; His master's voice
 28  0 ; No name
 29  0 ; Oh no not another magical event
 30  0 ; The Uh-oh song
 31  0 ; Owner of a lonely sword
 32  0 ; GAME OVER
;
; YM pieces not named above: 15, 16, 17 are the second parts of 11, 18
; and 2; 18 has no title and is not in the demo's menu.
